#: kiconedit.cpp:272
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "Novele Fi&gnesse"

#: kiconedit.cpp:274
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new Icon Editor window."
msgstr ""
"Novea purnea\n"
"\n"
"Po drovi ene novele fignese dins l' aspougneu d' imådjetes."

#: kiconedit.cpp:282
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Novea\n"
"\n"
"fé ene novele imådjete, a pårti d' on modele ou tot djhant si grandeu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Drovi\n"
"\n"
"Drovi ene imådjete k' egzisteye dedja"

#: kiconedit.cpp:302
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Schaper\n"
"\n"
"Schaper l' imådjete ki vos ovrez dsu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:313
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"Rexhe\n"
"\n"
"Drove on purnea avou sacwantès kesse po rexhe voste imådjete. (Mins ça n' "
"va nén co come ça duvreut"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Côper\n"
"\n"
"Côpe çu k' est tchwezi foû di voste imådjete\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: i gn a moyén di tchwezi des rectangues ou des ronds)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:334
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Copyî\n"
"\n"
"Po copyî çu k' est tchwezi foû di l' imådjete\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: i gn a moyén di tchwezi des rectangues ou des ronds)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:341
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"Aclaper\n"
"\n"
"Aclape çu k' i gn a dvins li tchapea emacralé dins voste imådjete.\n"
"\n"
"Si l' ådvins a aclaper est pus grand ki voste imådjete, vos l' poloz "
"aclaper dins onnovea purnea.\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: Tchwezixhoz \"Aclaper tot veyant hute des pixels\" dins li dviez "
"d' apontiaedje si vos voloz aclaper yåk k' on voet hute)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:350
#, fuzzy
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "Claper come &novea"

#: kiconedit.cpp:353
